    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <header class="ph"><span class="pico"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-db"/></svg></span><div><div class="pt">Cache</div><p class="pd">The cache keeps recent answers in memory, so asking for the same thing again is instant and uses no network. <b>TTL</b> (time to live) is how long an answer is trusted before it's fetched again.</p></div></header>
      <div class="opts" id="pxtt" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)"></div>
      <div class="btns"><button class="btn" id="pxcc" type="button">Clear cache</button><span class="meta" id="pxcn"></span></div>
    </div>
